{"ticker":"CELH","updated":"2026-10-30T22:39:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Celsius Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"Celsius Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","country":"United States","website":"https://celsiusholdingsinc.com","fullTimeEmployees":1497,"marketCap":7368380416,"trailingPE":126.608696,"forwardPE":17.178017,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4180236,"pegRatio":0.26,"targetMeanPrice":41.09524,"targetHighPrice":64.0,"targetLowPrice":26.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.106,"earningsGrowth":-0.569,"grossMargins":0.48759997,"operatingMargins":0.19087,"profitMargins":0.04237,"totalRevenue":3047273984,"beta":1.003,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":61.49,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":23.56,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NCM","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Celsius Holdings, Inc. develops, processes, manufactures, markets, sells, and distributes functional energy drinks in the United States, North America, Europe, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. The company offers CELSIUS ESSENTIALS, a functional energy drink formulated with aminos; and CELSIUS Hydration, a line of zero-sugar hydration powders featuring electrolytes in various fruit-forward flavors, as well as ready-to-drink energy beverages, on-the-go powder and hydration sticks, and nutrition and wellness products under CELSIUS, Alani Nu, and Rockstar brand names. It distributes its products through direct-to-store delivery, independent distributors, supermarkets, convenience stores, drug stores, nutritional stores, food service providers, and mass merchants, as well as natural food stores, fitness centers, mass market retailers, vitamin specialty stores, club stores, gyms, and e-commerce platforms. The company was formerly known as Vector Ventures, Inc. and changed its name to Celsius Holdings, Inc. in January 2007. Celsius Holdings, Inc. was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Boca Raton, Florida.","summary_zh":"攝氏控股公司在美國、北美、歐洲、亞太地區和國際上開發、加工、製造、行銷、銷售和分銷功能性能量飲料。該公司提供 CELSIUS ESSENTIALS，一種用氨基酸配製的功能性能量飲料； CELSIUS Hydration 是一系列零糖水合粉，以各種水果口味的電解質為特色，還有即飲能量飲料、隨身粉和水合棒，以及 CELSIUS、Alani Nu 和 Rockstar 品牌的營養和保健產品。它透過直接到店送貨、獨立分銷商、超市、便利商店、藥局、營養品商店、食品服務提供者和大眾商家，以及天然食品商店、健身中心、大眾市場零售商、維生素專賣店、俱樂部商店、健身房和電子商務平台分銷其產品。該公司前身為 Vector Ventures, Inc.，並於 2007 年 1 月更名為攝氏度控股有限公司 (Celsius Holdings, Inc.)。攝氏控股公司 (Celsius Holdings, Inc.) 成立於 2004 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州博卡拉頓。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 非酒精類","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":62.33,"h":62.33,"l":59.63,"c":61.41,"v":7005000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":61.62,"h":61.84,"l":60.62,"c":61.1,"v":4397100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":61.47,"h":62.64,"l":60.56,"c":60.76,"v":4748100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":61.19,"h":61.19,"l":57.7,"c":58.37,"v":5981400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":58.57,"h":58.57,"l":54.55,"c":55.64,"v":9721800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":55.77,"h":56.64,"l":55.45,"c":56.04,"v":4931200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":55.35,"h":56.63,"l":55.0,"c":56.22,"v":3339000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":57.8,"h":58.91,"l":56.93,"c":57.92,"v":5884600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":57.74,"h":58.3,"l":57.26,"c":57.82,"v":3094300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":57.08,"h":57.85,"l":56.03,"c":56.07,"v":4819800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":55.75,"h":55.94,"l":53.53,"c":55.27,"v":6636500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":55.27,"h":57.29,"l":55.2,"c":56.34,"v":4954800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":55.91,"h":56.71,"l":55.11,"c":55.19,"v":4471800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":55.84,"h":55.84,"l":53.76,"c":54.73,"v":6079900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":54.04,"h":54.07,"l":51.05,"c":51.34,"v":10602300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":51.28,"h":52.45,"l":50.8,"c":51.01,"v":5935400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":51.34,"h":52.92,"l":51.1,"c":51.88,"v":5742500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":51.55,"h":52.4,"l":51.16,"c":51.81,"v":4855300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":51.9,"h":54.61,"l":51.86,"c":54.39,"v":5831500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":55.53,"h":57.01,"l":54.81,"c":56.9,"v":6533600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":58.66,"h":58.9,"l":57.07,"c":57.49,"v":6381800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":57.18,"h":58.01,"l":5