oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"攝氏控股（納斯達克股票代碼：CELH）在第三季財報公佈前引起關注"},{"title":"Celsius Stock Pops: What's Going On?","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPRlpGaDNxN1V2aW5YOVRVcEFYWXN6NjF3S05WWW9OV19yZXZMWldMei1tcTlMUVJKM0Z6U1U5TEpMTDQyZFFWeGgwS2gyRDRuajhwMFZvSEpVVlhzcm1vcG9tYUtkY0NkemgwV3BjcktoWUFiRHRfckZrUF92elNsTDV5ZVFRWHd4ZkZRSEw1OW9qWXhzRTN1Z3Jn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"攝氏股票暴漲：發生了什麼事？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1341766/000134176626000024/celh-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"When used in this Report, unless otherwise indicated, the terms the \"Company,\" \"Celsius,\" \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" refer to Celsius Holdings, Inc. and its subsidiaries. Definitions of certain capitalized terms used in this Report are included within the Master Glossary.","zh":"在本報告中使用時，除非另有說明，術語「本公司」、「Celsius」、「我們」、「我們」和「我們的」均指 Celsius Holdings, Inc. 及其子公司。本報告中使用的某些大寫術語的定義包含在總術語表中。"},{"en":"Celsius operates as a functional energy drink and wellness beverage company in the U.S. and internationally. We develop, process, market, sell, manufacture and distribute a portfolio of differentiated products with innovative formulas meant to positively impact the lives of our consumers. Our products are positioned as premium lifestyle beverages designed to support active, wellness-oriented, modern energy drink consumers. Our portfolio primarily consists of energy drinks offered under the CELSIUS , Alani Nu and Rockstar brands, with CELSIUS and Alani Nu also offering a range of additional wellness products. Through these brands, we serve a broad range of consumers across the functional energy and adjacent wellness categories.","zh":"攝氏度是一家在美國和國際上運營的功能性能量飲料和健康飲料公司。我們開發、加工、行銷、銷售、製造和分銷一系列具有創新配方的差異化產品，旨在對消費者的生活產生正面影響。我們的產品定位為優質生活方式飲料，旨在支持活躍、注重健康的現代能量飲料消費者。我們的產品組合主要包括 CELSIUS、Alani Nu 和 Rockstar 品牌提供的能量飲料，CELSIUS 和 Alani Nu 也提供一系列其他健康產品。透過這些品牌，我們為功能性能量和相關健康類別的廣泛消費者提供服務。"},{"en":"Our products are available in the U.S., Canada, Europe, the Middle East and the Asia-Pacific regions. They are sold through multiple channels, including conventional grocery, natural-food and convenience stores, fitness centers, mass-market and vitamin specialty retailers and e-commerce platforms.","zh":"我們的產品銷往美國、加拿大、歐洲、中東和亞太地區。它們透過多種管道銷售，包括傳統雜貨店、天然食品和便利商店、健身中心、大眾市場和維生素專業零售商以及電子商務平台。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We introduced our first CELSIUS functional energy drink in 2005 and our portfolio has expanded significantly as we have broadened our brand platform. Today we offer a range of product lines under the CELSIUS , Alani Nu and Rockstar brands. Each brand features unique flavor profiles, formulations and consumer positioning, allowing us to serve a broad and diverse consumer base within the functional energy category.","zh":"我們於 2005 年推出了首款 CELSIUS 功能性能量飲料，隨著我們品牌平台的拓寬，我們的產品組合也顯著擴大。如今，我們提供 CELSIUS、Alani Nu 和 Rockstar 品牌的一系列產品線。每個品牌都具有獨特的風味特徵、配方和消費者定位，使我們能夠為功能性能量類別中廣泛且多樣化的消費者群提供服務。"},{"en":"We offer a unified portfolio of functional energy and wellness beverages across multiple brands, providing consumers with a variety of formats, flavor profiles and functional benefits. Certain products within our portfolio are formulated with ingredients such as caffeine, green tea extract (EGCG), ginger root extract, amino acids, vitamins, electrolytes and other performance-oriented components. Many products contain zero sugar, are low in calories and are designed to support energy, focus, hydration and overall wellness. Our portfolio includes the following primary product types:","zh":"我們提供跨多個品牌的功能性能量和健康飲料的統一產品組合，為消費者提供各種形式、風味特徵和功能優勢。我們產品組合中的某些產品採用咖啡因、綠茶萃取物 (EGCG)、薑根萃取物、胺基酸、維生素、電解質和其他以性能為導向的成分等成分配製而成。許多產品零糖、低熱量，旨在支持能量、注意力、水分和整體健康。我們的產品組合包括以下主要產品類型："}],"customers":[{"en":"Our customer base primarily consists of distributors, e-commerce retailers and various brick-and-mortar outlets, including grocery and convenience stores, club stores and health-focused locations such as gyms and nutrition stores. To support and incentivize the distribution, sales and marketing of our products, we rely on and provide various financial incentives. These incentives include but are not limited to volume-based rebates and promotions, placement fees, listing fees and other discounts.","zh":"我們的客戶群主要包括經銷商、電子商務零售商和各種實體店，包括雜貨店和便利商店、俱樂部商店以及健身房和營養店等注重健康的場所。為了支持和激勵我們產品的分銷、銷售和行銷，我們依靠並提供各種財務激勵措施。這些激勵措施包括但不限於基於數量的回扣和促銷、安置費、上市費和其他折扣。"},{"en":"In 2025, sales to Pepsi constituted 43.2% of our total revenue. As of December 31, 2025, receivables from Pepsi represented 46.2% of our total receivables. The loss of Pepsi or Pepsi's affiliates as our customers could significantly impact our operations, potentially resulting in a material adverse effect on our financial results.","zh":"2025年，百事可樂的銷售額占我們總收入的43.2%。截至2025年12月31日，百事可樂應收帳款占我們應收帳款總額的46.2%。失去百事可樂或百事可樂附屬公司作為我們的客戶可能會對我們的營運產生重大影響，並可能對我們的財務表現產生重大不利影響。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our products compete broadly with not only functional energy drinks, but all categories of non-alcoholic liquid refreshments. The functional energy drink and liquid refreshment sectors are highly competitive and include international, national, regional and local producers and distributors. Our direct competitors in the functional energy drink sector include but are not limited to Monster Beverage Corporation, Red Bull GmbH, The Coca-Cola Company, Pepsi, Keurig Dr Pepper Inc., Nestl S.A., BlueTriton Brands, Starbucks Corporation, Congo Brands and Molson Coors.","zh":"我們的產品不僅與功能性能量飲料競爭，還與所有類別的非酒精液體飲料競爭。功能性能量飲料和液體飲料行業競爭激烈，包括國際、國家、地區和當地的生產商和分銷商。我們在功能性能量飲料領域的直接競爭對手包括但不限於 Monster Beverage Corporation、Red Bull GmbH、可口可樂公司、百事可樂、Keurig Dr Pepper Inc.、Nestl S.A.、BlueTriton Brands、星巴克 Corporation、Congo Brands 和 Molson Coors。"},{"en":"We have registered, or have filed applications to register the CELSIUS , ALANI NU and ROCKSTAR trademarks, among others, with the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office, as well as a number of trademarks in other countries where our products are distributed and sold. Our trademarks are of considerable value and importance to our business and we actively maintain and renew these registrations to ensure their continued validity.","zh":"我們已向美國專利商標局註冊或已提交申請註冊 CELSIUS 、ALANI NU 和 ROCKSTAR 等商標，以及在我們產品經銷和銷售的其他國家/地區的多個商標。我們的商標對我們的業務具有相當大的價值和重要性，我們積極維護和更新這些註冊，以確保其持續有效。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2422490000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Europe","val":72544000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":12971000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other","val":7264000,"zh":"其他"}],"total":2515269000}},"peers":["ELF","HIMS","APP","SOFI","CAVA"]}}